Package: jungey-tv
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Section: video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jungey OS <jungey@localhost>
Depends: openjdk-21-jre, libgtk-3-0t64
Homepage: https://github.com/9bista-suven7/jungey-AI
Description: control center for a Samsung smart TV
 Jungey TV finds a Samsung smart TV on the home network and runs it from the
 desktop: power, volume, inputs, its menus, its apps, and any YouTube video.
 The jungey-tv command does the same one step at a time, which is how Jungey
 controls the TV by voice.
